{"4506090":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"肉鸽卡牌：商业帝国","steam_appid":4506090,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4746420],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> <\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Every card is a factory.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card you play is a fully functional factory. Once built, the factory automatically produces goods and sells them at the end of the turn, generating sales for you. All you need to do is choose the right factory cards to maximize your earnings within a limited number of turns.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4506090\/extras\/8191a08975243fc0c40ab48d6622541d.poster.avif?t=1788624397\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4506090\/extras\/8191a08975243fc0c40ab48d6622541d.webm?t=1788624397\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4506090\/extras\/8191a08975243fc0c40ab48d6622541d.mp4?t=1788624397\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The market shifts, times are unpredictable.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In every match, the events and opponents you face are random. Your character determines your starting point, the victory condition sets your direction, and luck and decisions decide your final outcome.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple paths to victory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each round ends, you can see the names of your opponents in this match and their detailed sales data, allowing you to formulate a winning plan accordingly.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4506090\/extras\/89203dbaad1f75f07ea7e58949476008.poster.avif?t=1788624397\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4506090\/extras\/89203dbaad1f75f07ea7e58949476008.webm?t=1788624397\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4506090\/extras\/89203dbaad1f75f07ea7e58949476008.mp4?t=1788624397\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Voting <\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can boost or weaken a certain industry, and also vote to forbid one player from taking action for one turn. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can see the passed resolutions and the specific voting results on the voting results page.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4506090\/extras\/e600ae5df1e199f67b8a4b8993da0b48.poster.avif?t=1788624397\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4506090\/extras\/e600ae5df1e199f67b8a4b8993da0b48.webm?t=1788624397\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4506090\/extras\/e600ae5df1e199f67b8a4b8993da0b48.mp4?t=1788624397\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Each match, you can choose your own victory condition:<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sales Revenue Victory: Achieve overwhelming sales dominance compared to other players in a single turn.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sales Volume Victory: Capture the absolute market share in terms of units sold in a single turn.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-Industry Prosperity Victory: Rank among the top players in each industry you participate in for that turn's sales.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Economic Victory: Amass a massive number of action points.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cumulative Sales Victory: Achieve the highest total cumulative sales after the turn limit is reached.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4506090\/extras\/350c1565f5a18aba1486600ed495a82d.poster.avif?t=1788624397\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4506090\/extras\/350c1565f5a18aba1486600ed495a82d.webm?t=1788624397\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4506090\/extras\/350c1565f5a18aba1486600ed495a82d.mp4?t=1788624397\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Leaderboard<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your winning accumulative total sales will be compared against the all-time best records of players worldwide. There is no pressure of real-time competition, but the joy of breaking records comes entirely from the precise decisions you make in just a few minutes.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> <\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Every card is a factory.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card you play is a fully functional factory. Once built, the factory automatically produces goods and sells them at the end of the turn, generating sales for you. All you need to do is choose the right factory cards to maximize your earnings within a limited number of turns.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4506090\/extras\/8191a08975243fc0c40ab48d662254